+ * hev_socks5_tunnel_clear_quit:
+ *
+ * Discard a quit that no running tunnel took. A quit while no tunnel runs is
+ * kept, and the next tunnel returns at once. Call this before the next tunnel
+ * starts, when no quit can come for the previous tunnel.
